					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: WRAP MODES\n\nIn this example we're projecting the texture from the Texture In node onto the mesh.\nNext we exposed the wrap modes on the Texture Material node.\nTry playing around with the wrap modes to see how they affect the mesh.\n\nNote that the Rectangle has UV's larger than 1 to make this work.\nAt UV [0,0,1,1] there is no need for wrapping as the UV is not repeated."
					}
				},
